      "text": "Chops makes a single Strike with a two-handed melee weapon. If he hits a target that is their size or smaller, that creature is Off-Guard until the end of the brute's turn, and he can automatically Shove: Athletics it with the same benefits as the Shove action (including the critical success effect, if the Strike was a critical hit). If Chops moves to follow the target, that movement doesn't trigger reactions. This Strike has the following failure effect.\n\nFailure The target becomes off-guard until the end of Chops's current turn."
